    "_postman_id": "e5f6a7b8-c9d0-1234-ef01-567890123456",
    "name": "Mentorix Backend",
    "description": "Коллекция по коду (`cmd/api`, `internal/auth`, `internal/admin`, `internal/exercise`, `internal/program`, `internal/health`).\n\n## Environments\n- **Mentorix Local** — `http://localhost:8080`\n- **Mentorix Render Dev** — `https://mentorix-backend.onrender.com`\n\n## Порядок smoke-теста (Programs)\n1. Health → Login\n2. POST /programs (сохраняет program_id, program_day_id; name=\"\")\n3. PATCH /programs/:id\n4. POST .../days/:day_id/exercises (нужен exercise_id)\n5. PUT .../exercises/:item_id (опционально)\n6. POST /programs/:id/publish\n7. POST /programs/:id/archive (опционально)\n8. DELETE /programs/:id",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.name) {",
          "    throw new Error('Выбери environment: Mentorix Local или Mentorix Render Dev');",
          "}",
          "const base = pm.environment.get('base_url');",
          "if (!base) {",
          "    throw new Error('base_url не задан в environment');",
          "}",
          "if (base.endsWith('/')) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('base_url', base.replace(/\\/+$/, ''));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
